{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主壬水生于申月，金水相生，身强。丙辰大运（35-44岁，2008-2017年）为偏财透干，辰为水库，财星有根，此运利于求财和变动。2015年乙未，伤官透出，地支未土与年支丑、日支辰形成丑未冲、辰未刑，且未为财库，冲刑引动财库，主变动、外出、创业之象。伤官代表新想法、技术或饮食（伤官生财，食伤多主饮食、技艺），且乙木伤官合日主壬水，有主动求变之意。2017年丁酉，正财透干，但酉金为印星，合入日支辰（辰酉合），主合作或稳定，但不如2015年冲刑带来的开创性强烈。2018年戊戌，七杀克身，压力大，且戌冲辰，变动但多主被动或风险。2019年己亥，正官合身，但亥水为比肩，主竞争而非创业。综合看，2015年冲刑引动财库，伤官生财，最符合出国创业，且伤官与饮食（食伤）相关。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "9087ad1f60082a49a671e44ab740fb3ce6fa01d7529ace2c06b2ac97fce0c2c8", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4366, "response_id": "f87b8b55-c0b4-4686-90e9-3bbf867c6758", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 553, "completion_tokens": 288, "total_tokens": 841, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 512}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 41}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主壬水生于申月得令，年柱癸丑、时柱壬子，水势极旺，身强无疑。月柱庚申偏印生身，全局金水过旺，喜火土调候制水。\n\n2021年辛丑，流年天干辛金为正印，地支丑土为正官。流年地支丑与命局年支丑、月支申（申丑暗合）、日支辰（辰丑相破）形成复杂关系，且丑与命局子水有合（子丑合），与辰有破，与申有合，整体土金水混杂。\n\n大运在乙卯（45-54岁，2018年起），伤官透干，主求财、创新、变动。流年辛金正印生身，但印星过旺反为忌，主压力、束缚、长辈之事。流年丑土正官为忌，主事业、官非、压力。伤官见印，有制化但印重，主计划受阻、决策失误。\n\n命局水旺，流年丑土为湿土，不能有效制水，反而助水势。2021年辛丑，天干辛金生水，地支丑土合子水、破辰水，水势更旺，主流动性、财务问题。命主身强忌水，流年水旺，主破财、投资失利。且大运乙卯伤官生财，但流年印星夺食伤，主生意上计划中断、资金链断裂。\n\n综合判断，2021年命主在生意上会遇到严重财务危机，且因印星为忌，主长辈健康问题，但选项中更贴合“生意下跌、资金周转不灵、倒闭”的为A。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "f046f8191079c8a47c9c663fad1a34ff01be0a83f96da9755b1ecef5b28f9c5c", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5887, "response_id": "28ff9db0-5ac0-4248-8402-7fad3f31e446", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 471, "completion_tokens": 389, "total_tokens": 860, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 87}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "th