{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主壬水生于申月得令，年柱癸丑、时柱壬子，水势极旺，属于身强水旺之局。2024年流年甲辰，天干甲木食神透出，地支辰土为水库，与命局中申、子形成三合水局，水势更旺。水旺则克火（心脏、血液循环），且水多泛滥，易有湿气、水肿、代谢问题。\n\n流年甲木食神代表饮食、口腹之欲，但甲木坐辰土（湿土），木气不旺，食神受制，说明饮食控制力差，容易暴饮暴食。同时，水旺土弱（辰土为湿土，但被水局冲荡），脾胃功能受损，消化吸收差，脂肪堆积，导致肥胖。命局中无火调候，水寒之气重，新陈代谢缓慢，更易发胖。\n\n其他选项：B脊椎问题多与金木交战或土弱有关，此局金水旺而木弱，但无直接冲克脊柱之象；C鼻癌多与金（肺）受克或火旺有关，此局金生水，肺气外泄，但无火克金之明显凶象；D车祸骨折多与木（筋骨）受克或驿马冲动有关，此局木弱但无冲刑，且水旺主智，行动谨慎，车祸概率低。\n\n综合判断，最符合的是饮食失控导致的肥胖问题。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "5c9eb27c14621acf85859cf8f26051052f37788afc0d9bca69a982d8eab48469", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4894, "response_id": "564599e6-3fc5-4250-b611-b14a6a65d33f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 470, "completion_tokens": 332, "total_tokens": 802, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 86}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
